  + [input] is the already proven strict request product
  + [runtime_failure] is invalid_request or unsupported_target before observation
  + [observed_result] is exactly one proven profile 0.2 record
  + [fault] carries no partial output
  + [complete] owns every copied string and scalar after the handle can drop

